{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196185-aedes-and-boons-new-signs-of-sorcery-spoilers","id":1196185,"title":"Aedes and Boons - New Signs of Sorcery Spoilers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-16T13:03:01-07:00","id":1196185,"title":"Aedes and Boons - New Signs of Sorcery Spoilers","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Welcome back, increasingly faithful (and patient) readers!</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">I know, I know. It\u2019s been a while.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Signs of Sorcery</b> is nigh-Developed. It\u2019s 93,000-out-of-97,000 words Developed. That last bit is proving tricky, but our long international nightmare will soon be over and I can get on with things like <b>Tome of the Pentacle</b> or <b>Fallen Worlds</b>.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">In response to requests for more, a little something for you.</span></span></span><br /> <b>Aedes and Boons</b><br /> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/walking-in-the-world-mage-the-awakening/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/walking-in-th...the-awakening/</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":618,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","user":"branford","date":". 03-16-2018, 06:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"